	(text "The tool's 5 V and ID run over the toolchanger's\nexisting wires (sheet Toolhead). On only when the\nhost says so (key locked, ID says \"power me\"); off\nat once, locally, when the ID line opens. R959 holds\nit off through a reset; R960: 1k across supplies.\nCheck: CTRL off when floating, on at 3.3 V."
